#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md:7
msgid "Stage"
msgstr "Stage"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md:9
msgid ""
"Built-in Strategies execute generation processing in units called "
"`Stage`. Stage is the sequential compatibility surface that supports "
"existing Algorithms and custom Stages."
msgstr ""
"組み込みStrategyは、世代処理を `Stage` という単位に分けて実行します。 "
"Stageは既存AlgorithmとカスタムStageを支えるsequential compatibility surfaceです。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md:12
msgid ""
"`Pipeline` is a structured DSL. It describes graph-native components, "
"nested Pipelines, `Repeat`, `Loop`, and `Branch`, but does not execute "
"`OptimizationState` directly. Optimizer delegates conversion of a "
"Pipeline into an executable plan to the Compiler internally. Ordinary "
"users do not need to call the Compiler directly."
msgstr ""
"`Pipeline` は構造化DSLです。 graph-native "
"component、入れ子のPipeline、`Repeat`、`Loop`、`Branch`を記述しますが、`OptimizationState`"
" を直接実行しません。 Pipelineを実行可能な計画へ変換する処理は、Optimizerが内部でCompilerへ委譲します。 "
"通常の利用者がCompilerを直接呼び出す必要はありません。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md:17
msgid ""
"This page explains the Stage compatibility contract, built-in Stages, and"
" how to implement a custom Stage. See "
"[Framework](../../framework/index.md) for implementing a graph-native "
"component."
msgstr ""
"このページでは、Stageの互換性用契約、組み込みStage、カスタムStageの実装方法を説明します。 graph-native "
"componentの実装方法は [Framework](../../framework/index.md) を参照してください。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md:20
msgid "Stage's role"
msgstr "Stageの役割"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md:22
msgid ""
"The boundary implemented by `Stage` is `execute(state: OptimizationState)"
" -> OptimizationState`. Stage receives an `OptimizationState`, performs "
"one operation, and returns the updated State. This boundary differs from "
"a graph-native component's `execute(StateView) -> StatePatch`."
msgstr ""
"`Stage` が実装する境界は `execute(state: OptimizationState) -> OptimizationState`"
" です。 Stageは `OptimizationState` を受け取り、一つの処理を行って更新後のStateを返します。 "
"この境界はgraph-native componentの `execute(StateView) -> StatePatch` とは異なります。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md:26
msgid "There are three class attributes."
msgstr "クラス属性は3つあります。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md:28
msgid ""
"**`name`**: A machine-readable identifier used for lookup via "
"`pipeline[\"name\"]`"
msgstr "**`name`**: `pipeline[\"name\"]`で検索する機械可読識別子"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md:29
msgid "**`label`**: A human-readable description"
msgstr "**`label`**: 人間が読める説明"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md:30
msgid "**`notation`**: The LaTeX notation used by `to_pseudocode()`"
msgstr "**`notation`**: `to_pseudocode()`で使うLaTeX表記"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md:32
msgid "Pipeline"
msgstr "パイプライン"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md:34
msgid ""
"`Pipeline` is a structural sequence.  Its entries can be graph-native "
"components, nested `Pipeline` values, or structured control values.  "
"Lowering preserves nested names as graph regions and keeps repeat/loop "
"progress resumable at runtime."
msgstr "`Pipeline`は構造化されたシーケンスです。要素にはグラフネイティブなコンポーネント、入れ子の`Pipeline`、構造化された制御値を指定できます。Loweringは入れ子の名前をグラフ領域として保持し、実行時にrepeat/loopの進行を再開できるようにします。"

